abstract: "Independent research project in progress (protocol v1.0 frozen 2026-11-24, not yet run). Simulation study of independent cascade and threshold diffusion on synthetic random, small-world and scale-free graphs, with a second test on one anonymized real friendship network. No findings yet. Developed with an AI research and development assistant (Claude, Anthropic), which is not an author."
